# API base URL baked into the frontend at BUILD time (an import.meta.env value,
# not a runtime var). Leave EMPTY for the same-domain deploy: the app calls
# /api/* on its own origin and the host Caddy routes those to the backend.
# Only set a full URL (e.g. https://api.example.com) if the API is served from a
# DIFFERENT domain, in which case the backend must allow that origin via CORS.
#
# This file is optional — with it absent, VITE_API_URL defaults to empty.
VITE_API_URL=
